<ns0:section xmlns:ns0="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="idb9a6bc5e-47c4-11f1-9a61-b1559996dfe8" identifier="/us/usc/t18/s3558"><ns0:num value="3558">§ 3558.</ns0:num><ns0:heading> Implementation of a sentence</ns0:heading><ns0:content>
<ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">The implementation of a sentence imposed pursuant to section 3551 is governed by the provisions of chapter 229.</ns0:p>
</ns0:content><ns0:sourceCredit id="idb9a6bc5f-47c4-11f1-9a61-b1559996dfe8">(Added <ns0:ref href="/us/pl/98/473/tII/s212/a/2">Pub. L. 98–473, title II, § 212(a)(2)</ns0:ref>, <ns0:date date="1984-10-12">Oct. 12, 1984</ns0:date>, <ns0:ref href="/us/stat/98/1991">98 Stat. 1991</ns0:ref>.)</ns0:sourceCredit>
<ns0:notes type="uscNote" id="idb9a6bc60-47c4-11f1-9a61-b1559996dfe8">
<ns0:note style="-uslm-lc:I74" role="crossHeading" topic="statutoryNotes" id="idb9a6bc61-47c4-11f1-9a61-b1559996dfe8"><ns0:heading class="centered"><ns0:b>Statutory Notes and Related Subsidiaries</ns0:b></ns0:heading></ns0:note>
<ns0:note style="-uslm-lc:I74" topic="effectiveDate" id="idb9a6bc62-47c4-11f1-9a61-b1559996dfe8"><ns0:heading class="centered smallCaps">Effective Date</ns0:heading><ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">Section effective <ns0:date date="1987-11-01">Nov. 1, 1987</ns0:date>, and applicable only to offenses committed after the taking effect of this section, see <ns0:ref href="/us/pl/98/473/s235/a/1">section 235(a)(1) of Pub. L. 98–473</ns0:ref>, set out as a note under <ns0:ref href="/us/usc/t18/s3551">section 3551 of this title</ns0:ref>.</ns0:p>
</ns0:note>
</ns0:notes>
